,title,link,text,language,family
0,Burarra people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burarra_people,"The Burarra people, also referred to as the Gidjingali, are an Aboriginal Australian people in and around Maningrida, in the heart of Arnhem Land in the Northern Territory.",Burarra,Australian
1,Burarra language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burarra_language,The Burarra language is an Australian Aboriginal language spoken by the Burarra people of Arnhem Land. It has several dialects.,Burarra,Australian
