5,Stream ABC Indigenous News Radio | Listen to Burarra playlist ...,https://soundcloud.com/darwinabc/sets/burarra,"Listen to Burarra, a playlist curated by ABC Indigenous News Radio on desktop and mobile.",Burarra,Australian
6,Burarra people — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/burarra_people,"Burarra culture is renowned for its artistic and ceremonial expressions, including bark paintings on stringybark using clan-owned designs, intricate song cycles like the Mun-jiburey manikay accompanied by dances, and music performed by groups such as The White Cockatoo.",Burarra,Australian
7,Burarra Manakay = Burarra songs | Catalogue | National ...,https://catalogue.nla.gov.au/catalog/4803029,"""A songbook in the Burarra language of central coastal Arnham Land, for use in the Burarra bilingual program at Maningrida Community Education Centre.""--Cover verso.",Burarra,Australian
8,Lomax Collection Recording of Burarra : Lomax... : Internet Archive,https://archive.org/details/rosettaproject_bvr_vertxt-a2_audio-1,Its relation to other Australian Aboriginal tribes and languages is negligible. speakers have good knowledge of the language and are affiliated with the Tiwi tribe. conversation 1: 2:25min...,Burarra,Australian
9,Burarra Manakay | AustLit: Discover Australian Stories,https://www.austlit.edu.au/austlit/page/7865514,"Includes songs about Australian animals as well as translations of Christian song such as 'Silent Night', 'Little Baby Jesus', and 'This is The Day' (with English and Burarra language text).",Burarra,Australian
